{"slug":"jim-mcgovern-american-politician","qid":"Q1337459","name":"Jim McGovern","desc":"United States Representative from Massachusetts","article":"Jim McGovern (American politician)","born":"1959-11-20","died":null,"birthplace":"Worcester","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"MA-02","f":2013,"u":null},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"MA-03","f":1997,"u":2013}],"summary":"James Patrick McGovern (born November 20, 1959) is an American politician who has been a member of the United States House of Representatives since 1997, representing Massachusetts's 2nd congressional district since 2013. A Democrat, he is the ranking member of the House Rules Committee, chaired the Congressional-Executive Commission on China, and is the co-chair of the Tom Lantos Human Rights Commission. His district, numbered as the 3rd district from 1997 to 2013, stretches from Worcester to the Pioneer Valley.","photo":{"f":"jim-mcgovern-american-politician.jpg","by":"U.S. House Office of Photography/House Creative Services","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jim_McGovern,_official_portrait,_116th_Congress.jpg"},"history":[{"y":2026,"o":"H","k":"MA-02","p":"D","n":"Jim McGovern","race":"MA-02"},{"y":2024,"o":"H","k":"MA-02","p":"D","v":251441,"s":68.64,"w":true,"n":"James P. McGovern"},{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"MA-02","p":"D","v":180639,"s":66.2,"w":true,"n":"James P McGovern"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"MA-02","p":"D","v":249854,"s":65.33,"w":true,"n":"James P McGovern"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"MA-02","p":"D","v":191332,"s":67.16,"w":true,"n":"James P McGovern"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"MA-02","p":"D","v":275487,"s":98.24,"w":true,"n":"James P McGovern"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"MA-02","p":"D","v":169640,"s":98.2,"w":true,"n":"James P McGovern"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"MA-02","p":"D","v":259257,"s":98.45,"w":true,"n":"James P McGovern"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"MA-03","p":"D","v":122708,"s":56.46,"w":true,"n":"James P McGov